            "value": "<p><em>Light Rain.</em> A volley of arrows blackens the sky.</p><p>Each creature in a 30-foot cone takes @Damage[6d6[piercing]] damage with a basic Reflex save. Creatures that critically fail are <strong>off-guard</strong> until the start of your next turn.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p><hr /><p><em>It enters at 6d6 and reaches 9d6 at rank 10 &mdash; under the standard area ladder's 11d6, because it comes as an addition to an existing Release Technique rather than replacing it.</em></p>"
